BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:Coordinating with the release of the dam in the Lehigh River\,
  this whitewater rafting trip is sure to be a blast. Perfect for all skil
 l levels. This is a great way to GET YOUR FEET WET! \n \nHow do I Sign-up
 ?\n\nRegister online through Fusion\, in the Student Recreation Center's 
 main office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students  $20 \
 ; Faculty/Staff $60\n\n \nWhere and when?\n\nSaturday\, July 25th\, 2026\
 n7:00am – 7:00pm\nBegins at Student Recreation Center\n\n \nWhat to bring
 : Lunch\, water\, snacks\, towel\, a change of clothes and sandals with a
  heel strap\, old sneakers\, or water shoes. Flip-flops or slides are not
  allowed. For warmer days\, wear a swim suit or quick-drying shorts/shirt
 \; for cooler days\, bring extra layers\, but no cotton. Wetsuits are inc
 luded for those that want them.Half/full wetsuits can be rented from the 
 organization. Half is $6\, full is $12\, jacket is $4. \n \nPotential Haz
 ards: Unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, limited v
 ision\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plants\, insect bites 
 and injury by running\, including sprains\, lacerations\, abrasions and f
 ractures.\n \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information ca
 n be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12482910
DTEND:20260725T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260725T033417Z
DTSTART:20260725T110000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Whitewater Rafting Trip
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12482910
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12482910
X-HOSTS:Campus Recreation
END:VEVENT
