DESCRIPTION:Free summer memberships at the Student Recreation Center are b
 ack and better than ever! This year\, we've extended the program to three
  full months (May 7 – August 7) and have newly upgraded fitness spaces an
 d equipment for you to enjoy. Membership provides unlimited access to our
  state-of-the-art facilities\, indoor heated pool\, and more. No registra
 tion required\, simply bring your employee ID to access the building all 
 summer long.\n\n\n\n\nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegistration not required\nFor
  employees of Montclair/Bloomfield\n\nWhere and when?\n\nWhenever SRC is 
 open\, from May 7th - August 7th \nStudent Recreation Center\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: 
 https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12475632
